    <p style="font-size: 9pt; margin-top: 10px;">NOTE: Due to a high number of applications for this academic year, it is a requirement to have a minimum score of 80pts. in the TOEFL iBT exam and a minimum of 60% in the Math Institutional Exam to enter the merit scholarship application scheme.</p>

